1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,547
Dotrino is an ecosystem of apps that builds security on trust between your devices.

2
00:00:05,497 --> 00:00:07,971
Accounts are created automatically.

3
00:00:07,971 --> 00:00:14,786
Your information is shared only between trusted devices, and it never leaves them unless you decide it should.

4
00:00:14,786 --> 00:00:19,221
To get started, choose the device you trust most: it will be your Vault.

5
00:00:19,221 --> 00:00:26,247
Your Vault can be your own phone, your personal computer, or Dotrino can host it so it's always available.

6
00:00:26,247 --> 00:00:28,668
Everything is end-to-end encrypted.

7
00:00:28,668 --> 00:00:32,707
No one outside your devices can see it, not even Dotrino.

8
00:00:32,707 --> 00:00:33,865
Welcome.

